{"sections":[{"slug":"规范理论","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"规范理论"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">规范理论</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“规范理论”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在经典电动力学中</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">规范对称性是通过电磁势来体现的</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">规范原理</span> (gauge principle) <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> Hermann Weyl 1928 <span lang=\"zh\">年的伟大发现</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">量子力学</span></h2>\n"}}}]}